# Content/

# === IDE and Editor ===
.vs/
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# === Agent / Assistant Workspace Meta ===
.agent
.agents/
.claude/
.codebase-memory/
skills-lock.json
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# === Claude Code Local ===
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# === Production Session State (local only) ===
production/session-state/
production/session-logs/
production/review-mode.txt

# === Eval Tooling ===
marrow/
CCGS Skill Testing Framework/

# === Runtime Artifacts (auto-generated) ===
docs/consistency-failures.md

# === Expansions (internal planning) ===
expansions/

